  <value name="description">Parses an EDIFACT-style JSON invoice envelope and produces a minimal X12 4010 810 Invoice document (ISA/GS/ST/BIG/N1x2/IT1+PID+TXI per line/TDS/CTT/SE/GE/IEA). EDIFACT message metadata is accepted but intentionally not mapped.</value>
  <value name="node_comment">Maps interchange + payload fields from a JSON invoice envelope into X12 4010 810. The input's optional EDIFACT-style message block (messageType/version/release/agency) and BGM-style codes (invoiceTypeCode, functionCode) are accepted but deliberately NOT mapped -- no EDIFACT-to-X12 crosswalk is defined for those fields, and reflecting them (or dropping them from the input contract entirely) is an open decision, not an oversight.</value>
  <value name="stateless">yes</value>
